Most important relationship to remember

This is probably the most important part for an interview:

Deployment
    ↓
ReplicaSet
    ↓
Pod
StatefulSet
    ↓
Pod
DaemonSet
    ↓
Pod
Job
    ↓
Pod
CronJob
    ↓
Job
    ↓
Pod

And remember:

Deployment   → stateless application
StatefulSet  → stateful application
DaemonSet    → one Pod per matching node
Job          → task runs and finishes
CronJob      → scheduled Job
ReplicaSet   → maintains Pod count

One key correction: ReplicaSet is usually not something you choose instead of Deployment. In normal application deployments,
you create a Deployment, and the Deployment creates/manages the ReplicaSet for you.


















